{
  "id": "AILABEL-NO-IMPLICIT-META",
  "title": "AI 生成内容的产出文件里没有隐式标识（generated_by / ai_generated 等元数据字段）",
  "severity": "medium",
  "source": "《人工智能生成合成内容标识办法》第5条（隐式标识：在生成合成内容文件的数据中添加属性信息，如生成合成内容属性、服务提供者名称/编码、内容编号）；《生成式人工智能服务管理暂行办法》第12条；GB 45438—2025《网络安全技术 人工智能生成合成内容标识方法》（强制性国标）第 5、6 章；附录 E（规范性）。",
  "advice": "显式标识给人看，隐式标识给机器看 —— 例如在元数据里写 generated_by / ai_generated / model / service_provider / content_id。它的作用是内容被搬运、被二次分发之后，仍然能追溯来源。建议在生成产物落库或落盘的那一层统一注入这些字段，并对下游传递做保留。",
  "check": {
    "type": "file-pattern",
    "when": "(openai|anthropic|deepseek|@deepseek-ai|google\\.generativeai|cohere|zhipuai|dashscope|qianfan|generateText|streamText|chat\\.completions|ChatOpenAI)",
    "pattern": "= *await +[A-Za-z_$][\\w$]*\\.(chat\\.completions\\.create|messages\\.create|responses\\.create|createChatCompletion)\\(|new ChatOpenAI\\(",
    "flags": "g",
    "exts": [
      ".js",
      ".mjs",
      ".cjs",
      ".ts",
      ".tsx",
      ".jsx",
      ".py",
      ".rb",
      ".php",
      ".go",
      ".java"
    ],
    "exclude": [
      "generated_by",
      "generatedBy",
      "ai_generated",
      "aiGenerated",
      "is_ai_generated",
      "aigc",
      "service_provider",
      "serviceProvider",
      "content_id",
      "contentId",
      "model_name",
      "modelName",
      "digital_signature",
      "signature"
    ],
    "max": 20
  }
}